# dsh-portable feature switches. Copy to data\portable.env (the build does this
# when the file is missing). No spaces around '='. Restart start.cmd / dsh.cmd
# after edits. Existing sessions keep the shell they started with.

# Agent and launcher shell: pwsh (default, Windows PowerShell / pwsh) or bash
# (bundled Git Bash). Bundled git.exe is always preferred over a system Git.
SHELL=pwsh
